    "created_at": "2025-07-23T13:06:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-23T13:12:17Z",
    "body": "Just wanted to say `console.read` should probably not be used for this purpose. As a user, I'd hope to be able to *read user input* from the console, as a future extension.\n\nSure, it could be called `console.input`, but having a `console.read` that's completely unrelated to reading input would be confusing for everyone.",
